  "sections": [
    {
      "tag": "header",
      "cls": "sb-globalNav",
      "text": "MENU\nREWARDS\nGIFT CARDS\nFind a store\nSign in\nJoin now",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Summer starts here",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "New Blue Coconut Lemonade Energy Refresher\nCoconut, strawberry and açaí flavors hand-shaken with lemonade, ice and blue spirulina. Boosted with caffeine and B vitamins. Enjoy for a limited time to help support clean water access for people in need through Water.org.*\nOrder now\nNew Iced Blue Coconut Matcha\nA tropical take on a favorite. Lush toasted coconut cream cold foam blended with blue spirulina atop an iced matcha with sweet mango flavors. Enjoy for a limited time to help support clean water access for people in need through Water.org.*\nStart an order",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "New Tropical Butterfly Lemonade Refresher\nA burst of summer. Layers of guava and passionfruit flavors shaken with lemonade and ice. With popping mango-pineapple flavored pearls and a splash of vibrant color infusion.\nOrder now\nNew Butterfly Drink\nA tropical vacation in every sip. A blend of pineapple and passionfruit flavors shaken with creamy coconutmilk and ice. With mango-pineapple flavored pearls and a splash of vibrant color infusion.\nStart an order",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "New Horchata Frappuccino® Blended Beverage\nA cool summer escape. Cinnamon, vanilla and toasted rice notes blended with coffee, creamy milk and ice. Topped with whipped cream and a dusting of cinnamon powder.\nStart an order\nIced Horchata Shaken Espresso\nA smooth and creamy pick-me-up. Our subtly sweet Starbucks® Blonde Espresso Roast meets warm cinnamon, vanilla and toasted rice notes. Then shaken with ice and topped with oatmilk.\nOrder now",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Mango Dragonfruit Energy Refresher\nUplifting and tropical. Mango and dragonfruit flavors shaken with ice and real dragonfruit pieces. Plus extra caffeine sourced from nature and a B-vitamin boost.\nOrder now\nStrawberry Açaí Energy Refresher\nA fresh fruity taste. Sweet strawberry and açaí flavors boosted with extra caffeine and B vitamins. Then hand-shaken with ice and real strawberry pieces.\nStart an order",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Toasted Coconut Cream Cold Brew\nA delicious twist on a coffeehouse favorite. Smooth Starbucks® Cold Brew layered with toasted coconut cream cold foam and finished with a sprinkle of coconut flakes. Contains dairy.\nOrder now\nIced Brown Sugar Oatmilk Shaken Espresso\nA flavorful recharge. With Starbucks® Blonde Espresso Roast combined with brown sugar and cinnamon. Shaken with ice and topped with creamy oatmilk.\nStart an order",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "Jalapeño Chicken Pocket\nSpicy and satisfying. Toasted chile lavash flatbread stuffed with diced chicken, charred poblanos, green jalapeños, three-chile-pepper cheese and jalapeño cream cheese.\nOrder now\nTomato & Mozzarella on Focaccia\nA craveable lunch favorite. Packed with 15 grams of protein. Featuring roasted tomatoes, mozzarella, spinach and basil pesto stacked on toasted focaccia bread.\nStart an order",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "cls": "",
      "text": "*For all modifications of Iced Blue Matcha and Blue Coconut Refresher purchased between June 16, 2026, and July 7, 2026, in participating U.S. stores and on the Starbucks® app, Starbucks will donate $0.25 to Water.org (www.water.org). This includes the Blue Coconut Energy Refresher, Blue Coconut Lemonade Energy Refresher, Ocean Energy Drink, Iced Blue Coconut Matcha, Blue Coconut Refresher or Ocean Drink. This donation will be used to help provide lasting access to clean water and sanitation for people around the world, providing up to 195,000 people with access to clean water or sanitation through a maximum donation of $975,000.",
      "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
      "color": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)",
      "font": "SoDoSans"
    },
    {
